      "updated": 1785941190609,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## TechSpec — Technical Specification\n\n### Stack\n| Camada    | Tecnologia              |\n|-----------|--------------------------|\n| Frontend  | [ex: React + TypeScript] |\n| Backend   | [ex: Node.js + Fastify]  |\n| Banco     | [ex: PostgreSQL]         |\n| ORM       | [ex: Prisma]             |",
      "fontSize": 20.932700892857152,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## TechSpec — Technical Specification\n\n### Stack\n| Camada    | Tecnologia              |\n|-----------|--------------------------|\n| Frontend  | [ex: React + TypeScript] |\n| Backend   | [ex: Node.js + Fastify]  |\n| Banco     | [ex: PostgreSQL]         |\n| ORM       | [ex: Prisma]             |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
